  "path": "morgan-territory",
  "body": "<p>Ride Stats:<br />\n12 riders (3 were leaders &#8212; thanks Chuck!!)<br />\nFinish times range:  ~6 hours, 10 minutes   to  ~8 hours, 30 minutes</p>\n<p>We had 1 flat near the end (once again to Hunter).</p>\n<p>We had 2 riders get severe &#8220;jump-off-the-bike-in-pain&#8221; cramps in the calves and hamstrings.  It was a longer and tougher ride than they were used to and it&#8217;s possible food and electrolytes may have added to that.  They rallied after large late lunches (with bananas and electrolyte drinks!) in Danville and were able to avoid bailing out early.  A+ for persistence and effort!</p>\n",
  "date": "2009-04-13T06:11:13Z",
